 "summary": "The file adds genuinely new material: Mathlib has no octonions or composition algebras, and no other TauCeti file states anything about derivations of \ud835\udd46. The proofs are built from located existing lemmas (Octonion.mul_self, mul_conj_add_mul_conj, add_conj, mem_imaginary_iff_conj_eq_neg, Mathlib's QuadraticMap.polar API, skewAdjointLieSubalgebra, LieModule.isFaithful_iff') rather than re-deriving them, and the rename leaves no compatibility shim.",
